This directory holds the OpenXPlay website. It is licensed in two parts:

- Code: everything that makes up the site's machinery, including .vitepress/,
  scripts/, package.json, package-lock.json and the workflow
  .github/workflows/pages.yml at the repository root, is licensed under the MIT
  License below (SPDX: MIT).

- Written content: the Markdown pages (index.md, quick-start.md, check.md,
  faq.md, developers.md, the same pages under en/, and README.md) are licensed
  under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (SPDX:
  CC-BY-4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Each source file states its licence in an SPDX header.

Material from elsewhere keeps its own terms and is not covered by either
licence: the pages show assets/openxplay-relay-animated.svg,
assets/openxplay-relay-animated-zh.svg and Group/Wechat_QQ_Group.jpg; the
diagrams use MiSans (https://hyperos.mi.com/font/), and public/og-image-en.png
and public/og-image-zh.png are rendered from those diagrams. The icons in public/
(logo.png, icon-192.png, favicon-32.png, apple-touch-icon.png) are rendered from
the OpenXPlay Relay app icon (https://github.com/OpenXPlay/OpenXPlay-Relay).

CarPlay and iPhone are trademarks of Apple Inc. OpenXPlay is an independent
project and is not affiliated with, endorsed or certified by Apple.

